  {"paper_ref": "Theorem 1.1, part 3", "lean_theorem": "OAI.SevenEighths.HeckeFamily.LFunction_ne_zero_of_seven_eighths_lt_re", "relation": "equivalent", "why": "The hypothesis hpole excludes exactly the principal-character pole point s = 1, avoiding the junk value there."}
